  IconPath: icons/creatures/mammals/humanoid-fox-cat-archer.webp
  Description: Why race a hare across a meadow, or a salmon up a waterfall? Why face
    a titan in a test of strength? Wouldn't it be better to best your foes with a
    bit of creativity? After all, the stories that echo throughout history are always
    those where wits and trickery, rather than raw talent or power, win the day.
    You are trained in Deception. After you Spark Transcendence, you can @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Create
    a Diversion] or @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Feint] as a free action.
